            <div xml:id="d704">

                <pb facs="1036" n="936" sameAs="frus:frus1934v01/pg936"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.4215 Air Pollution/498: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Minister in Canada</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Robbins</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1934-04-21T16:00:00-05:00">April 21, 1934—4
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>40. Your No. 38, April 20, 6 p.m. Department deems it important that note
                    embodying Nos. 300 and 303 be presented. Department has given assurance this
                    would be done.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
